usage: nvresource.py [-h] {plan,run} ...

Plan large-resource UCI checks without launching an engine; run only with
--start. This is a bounded execution aid, not a sandbox or a memory
reservation service. The input artifact and embedded resource constants are
never rewritten.

positional arguments:
  {plan,run}
    plan      read files/resources and save a plan; never run the target
    run       execute a previously saved plan only after --start

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
